# Custom storefront server / hosting environment
#
# Copy these variable names into the server-side environment for the storefront
# (for example, Vercel Project Environment Variables). Keep values out of source
# control and redeploy or restart the storefront after changing them.

# Required when the merchant storefront creates Razorpay orders server-side.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# Required when the storefront backend mints Chapman shopper-session tokens or
# serves the signed order feed. Derive the NAME from the public Chapman site key:
#   pk_my_store -> SITE_SECRET_MY_STORE
# Replace this example name with the store's real name, and set its VALUE to the
# exact site-signing secret Chapman generated. Do not generate a different value
# for the storefront and never expose this variable to browser JavaScript.
SITE_SECRET_MY_STORE=
